   "evidence": "The proof body is `ext U; rfl` and uses nothing about opens or homeomorphisms. `grep 'sheafCongr.*Additive'` in ./mathlib finds nothing, so no general version exists.",
   "file": "TauCeti/Topology/Sheaves/Homeomorph.lean",
