   "issue": "`Homeomorph.sheafCongr_additive` is stated only for `h.opensCongr.equivalence`, but the claim and its `ext U; rfl` proof hold for `(e.sheafCongr J K A).functor` with any equivalence `e`. General infrastructure is pinned to one case.",
