   "file": "TauCeti/Topology/Sheaves/CoverSystems.lean",
   "fix": "Tag `mapHomeomorph_trans` with `@[simp]`. Then `Homeomorph.symm_trans_self`/`self_trans_symm` and `mapHomeomorph_refl` handle both round-trip orders. Alternatively, add the missing `mapHomeomorph_mapHomeomorph_symm` simp lemma.",
   "issue": "`mapHomeomorph_trans` is the normal-form composition law but is not `@[simp]`, while `mapHomeomorph_refl` and `mapHomeomorph_symm_mapHomeomorph` are. Without it, simp cannot rewrite `(U.mapHomeomorph h.symm).mapHomeomorph h` to `U`, because the symm lemma only matches the `h` then `h.symm` order.",
